<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Your subscription payment is due soon</h1>
    <p>Hi{{#if recipient_name}} {{recipient_name}}{{/if}},</p>
    <p>This is a friendly reminder that your Growth Project subscription will renew on <strong>{{due_date}}</strong> for <strong>{{amount_display}}</strong>.</p>
    <p>No action is needed — we'll charge your card on file automatically. If you'd like to update your payment method or change plans, you can do that any time:</p>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{billing_portal_url}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Manage subscription</a>
    </p>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">Questions? Just reply to this email.</p>
  </body>
</html>
